Looking at this problem, I need to evaluate $\int_0^1 \left(\frac{1}{1-x}+\frac{1}{\ln x}\right)dx$.

**Answer leak check:** The problem statement contains only the integral to evaluate — no solutions, hints, or formalization notes. Proceeding to solve.

